    "name": "Lunaraxia: Magpie Sings of the World's End",
    "steam_appid": 3736260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lunaraxia: Magpie Sings of the World\u2019s End</i> is a Soulslike Roguelite inspired by classic arcade games such as <i>Punch-Out!!</i> and <i>Crossed-Swords</i> with narrative and gameplay loop of <i>Hades</i>. In this game, you will play as one of the five Ragpickers tasked with retrieving valuable Old World Relics to save your dying underground community. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/2ee80273782ddb1489dc361ba4786d18.avif?t=1754982249\" data-has-big width=800 height=368 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/6a405a2fd9e4d2868614d81c80e04fff.poster.avif?t=1754982249\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/6a405a2fd9e4d2868614d81c80e04fff.webm?t=1754982249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/6a405a2fd9e4d2868614d81c80e04fff.mp4?t=1754982249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lunaraxia</i> delivers <strong>modern Soulslike combat experience</strong> with arcade classics' simplicity, freeing you of any infamous detractors.*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lunaraxia</i> boasts <strong>hand-drawn, carefully timed sprites</strong> that telegraph each attack intuitively, allowing you to parry and dodge attacks you see for the first time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(* Wonky cameras, confusing hitboxes and frames) <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/cbfe571f3d4b75661e094c1b654eb5ec.avif?t=1754982249\" data-has-big width=800 height=368 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your typical <i>Lunaraxia</i> run is planned to have you progress through 3 areas and 3 bosses, while showering you with different Weapons, Shields, and Relics to try out different builds each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soulslike mechanics</strong> (such as Dodge, Parry, Guard, Charged Heavy Attack, \u2026) <strong>function as triggers for your Relics</strong>, allowing you to pursue synergies based on whatever mechanics you feel most comfortable with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/fcc8219efa31c3e0deacc7dab1520d19.poster.avif?t=1754982249\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/fcc8219efa31c3e0deacc7dab1520d19.webm?t=1754982249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/fcc8219efa31c3e0deacc7dab1520d19.mp4?t=1754982249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For instance, the above showcases a build centered around Parries and Charged Heavies. By combining</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Relic that <strong>instantly fully charges </strong>your next <strong>Charged Heavy </strong>upon <strong>Parrying</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Relic that applies a high amount of <strong>Stagger</strong> to all enemies upon landing <strong>Fully-Charged Heavy</strong>, and</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Relic that boosts your <strong>Critical Hit Chance</strong> (up to 4 times) upon successfully <strong>Staggering </strong>an enemy<strong>,</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can effectively wipe out weak enemies with a single Parry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/1296d2c7f061cc5ae5e91a840c2de929.avif?t=1754982249\" data-has-big width=800 height=368 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lunaraxia </i>boasts a unique cast of 5 lovable characters with <strong>intertwining backstories and fates that eventually decide the fate of this ending universe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fascinating world has been built, with influences from modern Korea, body horror, creepypastas, and SF novels with <strong>multi-layered narratives for you to discover</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover why the Old World has collapsed, for what purpose the Flesh Moon rose, and how the post-apocalyptic community of Chorim High School is run</strong> by discovering hidden dialogues and documents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/0cc41829828cd6cdefcc680c34710f82.avif?t=1754982249\" width=576 height=324 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/250d867e32d53fb32c35b75f9e4ab12e.poster.avif?t=1754982249\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/250d867e32d53fb32c35b75f9e4ab12e.webm?t=1754982249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/250d867e32d53fb32c35b75f9e4ab12e.mp4?t=1754982249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/651374306a7a3c45fdcf68c561915ad5.poster.avif?t=1754982249\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/651374306a7a3c45fdcf68c561915ad5.webm?t=1754982249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/651374306a7a3c45fdcf68c561915ad5.mp4?t=1754982249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/33d7206c7ab6701266f38e0570369917.avif?t=1754982249\" data-has-big width=800 height=368 /></span></p>",
