src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/1296d2c7f061cc5ae5e91a840c2de929.avif?t=1754982249\" data-has-big width=800 height=368 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lunaraxia </i>boasts a unique cast of 5 lovable characters with <strong>intertwining backstories and fates that eventually decide the fate of this ending universe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fascinating world has been built, with influences from modern Korea, body horror, creepypastas, and SF novels with <strong>multi-layered narratives for you to discover</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover why the Old World has collapsed, for what purpose the Flesh Moon rose, and how the post-apocalyptic community of Chorim High School is run</strong> by discovering hidden dialogues and documents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/0cc41829828cd6cdefcc680c34710f82.avif?t=1754982249\" width=576 height=324 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/250d867e32d53fb32c35b75f9e4ab12e.poster.avif?t=1754982249\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/250d867e32d53fb32c35b75f9e4ab12e.webm?t=1754982249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/250d867e32d53fb32c35b75f9e4ab12e.mp4?t=1754982249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/651374306a7a3c45fdcf68c561915ad5.poster.avif?t=1754982249\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/651374306a7a3c45fdcf68c561915ad5.webm?t=1754982249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/651374306a7a3c45fdcf68c561915ad5.mp4?t=1754982249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736260/extras/33d7206c7ab6701266f38e0570369917.avif?t=1754982249\" data-has-big width=800 height=368 /></span></p>",
